{
  "lineCounts": {
    "Columbina": 30,
    "Player": 13
  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7606501",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "760650101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "760650101": {
            "id": "760650101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "You're here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760650102"
            ]
          },
          "760650102": {
            "id": "760650102",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Columbina... you're here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760650103"
            ]
          },
          "760650103": {
            "id": "760650103",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "Mm, and now you're here too. So I suppose we're here together.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760650104"
            ]
          },
          "760650104": {
            "id": "760650104",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "You say that as if you knew I'd come.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760650105"
            ]
          },
          "760650105": {
            "id": "760650105",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "I didn't know when, but I knew you'd come eventually.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760650106"
            ]
          },
          "760650106": {
            "id": "760650106",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "Just as there is always a pull between the moon and Teyvat. You always find your way to me, don't you?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760650107"
            ]
          },
          "760650107": {
            "id": "760650107",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "Come, sit with me for a while. I saved you a seat.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760650108"
            ]
          },
          "760650108": {
            "id": "760650108",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "Last time we sat on your ship, we were looking at Teyvat. Let's look at the stars this time.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760650109"
            ]
          },
          "760650109": {
            "id": "760650109",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "Ninnin and those who came before her were drawn to those stars. There must be a different kind of gravity there. I can feel it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760650110"
            ]
          },
          "760650110": {
            "id": "760650110",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Ninnin and the message she sent...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760650111"
            ]
          },
          "760650111": {
            "id": "760650111",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "Don't worry. She's not in danger.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760650112"
            ]
          },
          "760650112": {
            "id": "760650112",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "She traveled very, very far in safety — so far that I can no longer sense the power I used to guide her on her way.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760650113"
            ]
          },
          "760650113": {
            "id": "760650113",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "But... I'm curious.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760650114"
            ]
          },
          "760650114": {
            "id": "760650114",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "About what?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760650115"
            ]
          },
          "760650115": {
            "id": "760650115",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "All kinds of things. For instance... Would a message from a Moongazer ever be received by someone else?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760650116"
            ]
          },
          "760650116": {
            "id": "760650116",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "Whoever receives it — or whatever else may receive it... who might they be?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760650117"
            ]
          },
          "760650117": {
            "id": "760650117",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "What would they think? Would they know love and hatred just like us?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760650118"
            ]
          },
          "760650118": {
            "id": "760650118",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "Would they still be drawn to the beautiful yet mysterious sky above, even with the abyss closing in around them, just like us?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760650119"
            ]
          },
          "760650119": {
            "id": "760650119",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "Would they, like us, also want to find others, wave at them, and say, \"Hello, friend. I'm happy to meet you\"?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760650120"
            ]
          },
          "760650120": {
            "id": "760650120",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760650121"
            ]
          },
          "760650121": {
            "id": "760650121",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "Out there, in the depths of this starry sky... Are there still civilizations untouched by the darkness?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760650122"
            ]
          },
          "760650122": {
            "id": "760650122",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I think there are.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760650123"
            ]
          },
          "760650123": {
            "id": "760650123",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "Hmm?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760650124"
            ]
          },
          "760650124": {
            "id": "760650124",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Our ship once received a message.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760650125"
            ]
          },
          "760650125": {
            "id": "760650125",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "What kind of message?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760650126"
            ]
          },
          "760650126": {
            "id": "760650126",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Almost all of its meaningful content was lost.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760650127"
            ]
          },
          "760650127": {
            "id": "760650127",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "But it must have come from an intelligent civilization.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760650128"
            ]
          },
          "760650128": {
            "id": "760650128",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "Lost... Was it because it had traveled too far...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760650129"
            ]
          },
          "760650129": {
            "id": "760650129",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "Still, even this much is encouraging enough.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760650130"
            ]
          },
          "760650130": {
            "id": "760650130",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "#By the way, {NICKNAME}...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760650131"
            ]
          },
          "760650131": {
            "id": "760650131",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Hmm?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760650132"
            ]
          },
          "760650132": {
            "id": "760650132",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "Your birthplace... It's out there too, isn't it?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760650133"
            ]
          },
          "760650133": {
            "id": "760650133",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "If one day, you decide to return to where your journey began, to clean it up...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760650134"
            ]
          },
          "760650134": {
            "id": "760650134",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "I'd be glad to lend a hand. Just like how you helped me clean the moon.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760650135"
            ]
          },
          "760650135": {
            "id": "760650135",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Then I won't forget to invite you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760650136"
            ]
          },
          "760650136": {
            "id": "760650136",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "And another party?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760650137"
            ]
          },
          "760650137": {
            "id": "760650137",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "And another party.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760650138"
            ]
          },
          "760650138": {
            "id": "760650138",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "Then...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760650139"
            ]
          },
          "760650139": {
            "id": "760650139",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "What do you think of calling it \"Home-Returning Night\"?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760650140"
            ]
          },
          "760650140": {
            "id": "760650140",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "What if it's during the day?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760650141"
            ]
          },
          "760650141": {
            "id": "760650141",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "Then we'll celebrate all day until night falls. We can invite all our good friends.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760650142"
            ]
          },
          "760650142": {
            "id": "760650142",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Sounds like it's gonna be very fun.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760650143"
            ]
          },
          "760650143": {
            "id": "760650143",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "May that night arrive beneath clear skies... with friends reunited."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}